{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100115","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100115/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100115/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100115/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100115","id":2723777390,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6iWYtu","number":100115,"title":"FileAccess store calls don't work after 4.4dev5 to 4.4.dev6 upgrade","user":{"login":"danielglx","id":178185831,"node_id":"U_kgDOCp7mZw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178185831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx","html_url":"https://github.com/danielglx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-12-06T19:32:07Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:45:37Z","closed_at":"2024-12-06T20:43:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Not Reproducible on godot_v4.4-dev5_mono_win64\n- Reproducible on godot_v4.4-dev6_mono_win64\n\nSimple calls to FileObject.Store functions in C# will throw the following error:\n\nERROR: System.MissingMethodException: Method not found: 'Boolean Godot.FileAccess.Store16(UInt16)'.\n\nI also tried StoreVar(), same result. Otherwise, game works normally. Perhaps something got broken in the C# libraries when we made this change:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78289\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.4-dev6_mono_win64\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot v4.4.dev5.mono - Windows 10.0.22631 - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700K (20 threads)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create an application in C# that involves the FileAccess call, for instance:\n\n```\nusing var saveFile = FileAccess.Open(filename, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Write);\nif (saveFile == null) {\n    OS.Alert(\"Error saving game: \" + saveFile.GetError());\n} else {\n    saveFile.Store16(0);\n}\n```\n\nYou will see a ERROR: System.MissingMethodException: Method not found: 'Boolean Godot.FileAccess.Store16(UInt16)'.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```\nusing var saveFile = FileAccess.Open(filename, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Write);\nif (saveFile == null) {\n    OS.Alert(\"Error saving game: \" + saveFile.GetError());\n} else {\n    saveFile.Store16(0);\n}\n```","closed_by":{"login":"danielglx","id":178185831,"node_id":"U_kgDOCp7mZw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178185831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx","html_url":"https://github.com/danielglx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielglx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100115/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}